      <p>
        KWIZZ Radio was established in Ottawa to provide a dedicated, authentic musical home for lovers of Caribbean music. While mainstream radio often overlooks the depth of reggae culture, KWIZZ Radio brings the full spectrum: from foundational 1970s rocksteady and conscious roots to heavy UK dubs, lovers rock, and the latest dancehall riddims out of Kingston, London, and Toronto.
      </p>
